{"lines":[{"t":"1718867188","y":0.046511627815394085,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.069958845774332645,"c":0.5,"x":0.7716049391467531},{"t":"I see there are a number of children here with you today. Well, we have several activities","w":0.65843622843424476,"x":0.10082303794037481,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.097383720823858821},{"t":"specially for children, like dressing up in the sorts of clothes that children wore in the past,","w":0.66666666666666663,"x":0.10082305356652929,"y":0.11042402819420483,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"and as it's a fine day, some of you will probably want to play in the adventure playground. Our","w":0.69341562906901044,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.10288066272951425,"c":1,"y":0.12632508820678479},{"x":0.100823046480758,"c":1,"t":"latest addition is child-sized tractors, that you can drive around the grounds.","h":0.014534882858869391,"y":0.13953488397027458,"w":0.56378601074218748},{"x":0.10082306387663152,"w":0.68312754313151036,"c":1,"t":"We'll also be going into the farm that's part of the estate, where there's plenty to do. Most of","y":0.18021201395258957,"h":0.014555427295159129},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.69547322591145833,"t":"the buildings date from the eighteenth century, so you can really step back into an agricultural","x":0.098765444554864149,"y":0.19611307392871413,"c":1},{"y":0.2101062034253075,"x":0.10189737642744762,"c":1,"h":0.01266344247914597,"w":0.040487632751464858,"t":"past."},{"x":0.10288066649770608,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.66872426350911451,"t":"Until recently, the dairy was where milk from the cows was turned into cheese. It's now the","y":0.23110465105597289},{"t":"place to go for lunch, or afternoon tea, or just a cup of coffee and a slice of homemade cake","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.10288065644921175,"w":0.67901234944661459,"y":0.24705535919211463},{"t":"The big stone building that dominates the farm is the large barn, and in here is our collection","y":0.26691914100212322,"h":0.015517151678689611,"x":0.10076579288850979,"c":1,"w":0.68529123942057302},{"t":"of agricultural tools. These were used in the past to plough the earth, sow seeds, make gates,","x":0.10288066272035261,"y":0.281976744066327,"c":1,"w":0.69341562906901044,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"w":0.12551439921061197,"t":"and much more.","x":0.10288066037411786,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.29796511616317756},{"t":"There's a small barn, also made of stone, where you can groom the donkeys and horses, to","c":1,"y":0.31831395336879953,"x":0.10288065644826209,"h":0.013081395583944833,"w":0.67901234944661459},{"x":0.10279362825589307,"y":0.32943240135414564,"t":"keep their coats clean. They really seem to enjoy having it done, and children love grooming","h":0.017460429907125929,"c":1,"w":0.68126658121744788},{"t":"them.","y":0.34787220646585948,"w":0.048310839335123701,"h":0.010657367773696302,"c":1,"x":0.10039846100541427},{"t":"The horses no longer live in the stables, which instead is the place to go to buy gifts, books,","x":0.10288066461043381,"y":0.36918604639204289,"w":0.68106994628906259,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.10288066681539651,"t":"our own jams and pickles, and clothes and blankets made of wool from our sheep.","w":0.61111109415690101,"y":0.38368668996022726},{"w":0.69547322591145833,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.1008230577217384,"t":"Outside the shed, which is the only brick building, you can climb into a horse-drawn carriage for","y":0.40547703169566374,"c":1},{"h":0.014706386413394501,"c":1,"y":0.41716130902162807,"t":"a lovely, relaxing tour of the park and farm. The carriages are well over a hundred years old.","w":0.66675857543945316,"x":0.10283782663648292},{"h":0.01454001966999896,"w":0.67489710489908861,"x":0.1008230523612022,"t":"And finally, the parkland, which was laid out in the eighteenth century, with a lake and trees","y":0.44040697661080752,"c":1},{"w":0.68312759399414058,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"that are now well established. You'll see types of cattle and sheep that are hardly ever found","c":1,"x":0.10288064737851045,"y":0.45494186035827977},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"w":0.66666666666666674,"t":"on farms these days. We're helping to preserve them, to stop their numbers falling further.","x":0.10288065834181442,"y":0.46937573602722882},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"OK, well if you'd like to come with me ...","w":0.29835390726725258,"y":0.49116607778575005,"c":1,"x":0.10288065940827096},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.81893004154638593,"t":"Q14","y":0.12499999985917065,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1},{"t":"Q15","x":0.81893004154638593,"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.23110465100435762,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.81893004153995586,"t":"Q16","w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.26744186032642436,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"Q17","x":0.81893004153995586,"y":0.31831395334968016,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.36773255797837656,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"x":0.81893004153995586,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q18"},{"y":0.40406976725163224,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q19","x":0.8189300416085431,"c":1},{"y":0.45494186032428685,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q20","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.81893004154638593},{"h":0.013266274729662464,"t":"PART 3","w":0.098814169565836593,"y":0.54496569983044485,"c":1,"x":0.10079867643102049},{"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.10288065853937409,"y":0.57267441848994483,"t":"ED:"},{"t":"GEMMA:","x":0.10288065758354684,"c":1,"w":0.053497943878173831,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.60174418595070056},{"w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.10288065853937409,"y":0.61627906965273549,"t":"ED:","h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1},{"h":0.0091156274325996378,"w":0.053624114990234381,"c":1,"t":"GEMMA:","x":0.10281757246242158,"y":0.65823288386848233},{"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.0087209298276507141,"c":1,"x":0.10288065884801606,"y":0.67296511633617462,"t":"ED:"},{"w":0.053497943878173845,"x":0.10288065815350565,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"c":1,"t":"GEMMA:","y":0.7020348838143724},{"x":0.10082304497181456,"w":0.026748971939086916,"t":"ED:","y":0.72965116254085649,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"t":"GEMMA:","y":0.77362205382436577,"w":0.054071699778238946,"c":1,"h":0.010035322748730091,"x":0.10261287000432243},{"t":"Did you make notes while you were watching the performances of Romeo and","x":0.19341562551286046,"w":0.58024693806966154,"y":0.57122093012599684,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"t":"Juliet, Gemma?","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"y":0.58568904596519833,"w":0.11728394826253252,"x":0.1934156389364145},{"h":0.014550291607320909,"c":1,"x":0.19135801516000678,"t":"Yes, I did. I found it quite hard though. I kept getting too involved in the play.","y":0.60029069754089637,"w":0.5617284138997396},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"Me too. I ended up not taking notes. I wrote down my impressions when I","x":0.19341563116428898,"w":0.54320988972981776,"c":1,"y":0.61482558128864595},{"w":0.56378601074218748,"x":0.19135802337461447,"y":0.62779740852897492,"c":1,"t":"got home. Do you mind if I check a few things with you? In case I've missed","h":0.014723203769140158},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"anything. And I've also got some questions about our assignment.","x":0.19341564780921572,"y":0.64389534873011001,"w":0.48971191406250003},{"t":"No, it's good to talk things through. I may have missed things too.","w":0.48971191406250003,"y":0.65694935203163041,"c":1,"x":0.19135803461378542,"h":0.014562276002234698},{"y":0.66939826716113771,"t":"OK great. So first of all, I'm not sure how much information we should include in","x":0.19335277060833059,"w":0.5906605021158855,"h":0.015824966071210866,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Right. Well, I don't think we need to describe what happens. Especially as","x":0.19135801704792318,"y":0.70053003552870496,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.54938273111979163},{"c":1,"x":0.19135802697070706,"t":"Romeo and Juliet is one of Shakespeare's most well-known plays.","y":0.71366279094701879,"h":0.01454686725378318,"w":0.49382715861002613},{"y":0.72819767466794905,"h":0.014534882858869391,"c":1,"x":0.19135803541144222,"t":"Yeah, everyone knows the story. In an essay we'd focus on the poetry and","w":0.55349792480468751},{"y":0.74263839811281562,"w":0.60493825276692714,"c":1,"x":0.19135803400230184,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Shakespeare's use of imagery etc., but that isn't really relevant in a review. We're"},{"w":0.4732510375976563,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.19341563337917733,"c":1,"y":0.75872093012497333,"t":"supposed to focus on how effective this particular production is."},{"y":0.77179034155789916,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. We should say what made it a success or a failure.","w":0.43004114786783848,"h":0.01309337941721278,"x":0.19341564187540855},{"y":0.86773255798110183,"t":"103","x":0.84567901158204883,"w":0.039094651540120484,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.95318838681904849,"w":0.30809417724609378,"h":0.033713586760072745,"c":1,"x":0.66992476294405623}],"w":2400,"h":3395}